# Conformance probe pack for `until:3 chars:ascii7` (spec 0.22): a terminator
# other than NUL, so NUL is a character of the text (ruling 6). Public. No
# kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   label  7-bit characters up to the code 3
format     conformance-long-until-ascii7
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:3  chars:ascii7
